leted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.1.stable.mono.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-9700 CPU @ 3.00GHz (8 threads) - 15.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nOccasionally, seemingly at random, Godot spawns infinite VSCode instances in a loop that freezes your PC permanently. You might be able to sign out, but most likely you will need to hard-reset your PC.\n\nI first encountered this bug on Dec 18, 2025. The second time, on Dec 23, 2025, I took the following photos. The third time it happened was today (Jan 17, 2026), so I decided to open this issue.\n\nI believe this issue may be the same as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/19841.\n\nPhotos:\n\n<img width=\"2040\" height=\"1530\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/086bf721-00d5-498e-a7d3-5b3387744f7f\" />\n\n<img width=\"806\" height=\"1982\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b703763-3fa4-4f6c-aeec-c17779680ddd\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open project in Godot .NET\n- Press the script button next to a node to spawn an instance of VSCode\n- ???\n- Infinite instances of VSCode are spawned\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nImpossible to obtain an MRP due to this bug being rare and it crashing your PC before you can obtain any diagnostics.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us